Z||000000||TylerB11||10-29-2001||11:26 AM||||My 85GT that died and wouldn't start has been fixed, thanks to you guys. I changed the fuel pump and strainer on saturday. <BR>Word of caution - if you have to drop the tank, don't use ramps, It can be done, but its a real B*tch. <BR>Wow, I never realized how much power I was missing out on, the car runs like a champ now!<BR>I want to run some injector cleaner through it now,  which ones do you guys recommend? My brother was telling me about a can of stuff you hook to the schrader valve, and take out the FP fuse, and the car runs off this stuff for a couple minutes and it cleans the injectors good.<P>Once again, thank you all that gave me pointers and help!||||reg||1
Z||000001||samoht||10-29-2001||11:33 AM||||i have had real good luck with STP..  I think it comes in a black bottle..  8 or 10 dollars a bottle.. yeah the areosol style works good, bu tis expensive..  but I think the gas additive will clean your whole system better...YW<P>85gt3.2||||reg||1
